<title>USA: U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38532.</title>
<headline>U.S. SDR rate moved to 1.38532.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Monetary Fund said the exchange value of the U.S. dollar against the SDR was 1.38532, versus 1.38625 yesterday and 1.20635 on July 1, 1974.</p>
<p>Other currency values against the SDR today (July 1, 1974 rates in parentheses) were.</p>
